@lshreddeuse4689 have you never heard of “putting your emotions somewhere productive”? 
When I’m angry or depressed, I write. Do you think I write about happy sunshine and rainbows? No. I write about fucked shit. Because it’s somewhere to put the fucked shit.

It’s the SAME thing here. He’s putting the negativity in his head somewhere productive and positive. Just because you don’t like it doesn’t make it less positive.

Woow
